#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-range.md:1
#: 7525154f64dd402abc081b32ce33c47c
#
msgid "按范围选择（Select by Range）"
msgstr "Select by range"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-range.md:3
#: 8fec85946313405cb10e93e3ab0619dd
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-range.md:5
#: 62f93e93ad8d4f5f86cf0f91a18d85cb
msgid ""
"按照当前散点图的 x/y 数值范围选中结构。适合截取误差长尾、能量区间或描述符图中的局部点群。 切换到另一张图后，x/y "
"的物理含义也会随当前坐标轴改变。"
msgstr ""
"Select structures by x/y ranges on the current scatter plot. This is "
"useful for isolating an error tail, an energy interval, or a local "
"cluster in descriptor space. After switching plots, the physical meaning "
"of x and y changes with the displayed axes."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-range.md:8
#: b5da3d21fd464035bcfcc1154bfb6a30
msgid "判定原理"
msgstr "Decision principle"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-range.md:10
#: 5f90abd5df864807b8ff700b166dbf08
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"设当前点的横、纵坐标为 $x_i,y_i$，输入范围为 $[x_{\\min},x_{\\max}]$ 和 "
"$[y_{\\min},y_{\\max}]$。程序先自动交换写反的上下限，再计算"
msgstr ""
"Let the current point coordinates be $x_i,y_i$, with entered ranges "
"$[x_{\\min},x_{\\max}]$ and $[y_{\\min},y_{\\max}]$. The program first "
"swaps any reversed limits, then evaluates"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-range.md:13
#: d7f394925ce64cae99212a3c2f63e082
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"M_x(i)=(x_{\\min}\\le x_i\\le x_{\\max}),\\qquad\n"
"M_y(i)=(y_{\\min}\\le y_i\\le y_{\\max}).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"M_x(i)=(x_{\\min}\\le x_i\\le x_{\\max}),\\qquad\n"
"M_y(i)=(y_{\\min}\\le y_i\\le y_{\\max}).\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-range.md:18
#: fc7fba8916e34abb8c2019959279d2c2
msgid ""
"`同时满足（AND）`使用 $M(i)=M_x(i)\\land M_y(i)$；`任一满足（OR）`使用 $M(i)=M_x(i)\\lor "
"M_y(i)$。边界点会被选中。这里比较的是**当前子图实际显示的数据**， 不是固定的能量或力字段，因此运行前先看清坐标轴名称。"
msgstr ""
"`Match both (AND)` uses $M(i)=M_x(i)\\land M_y(i)$; `Match either (OR)` "
"uses $M(i)=M_x(i)\\lor M_y(i)$. Boundary points are included. The "
"comparison uses the data actually displayed on the current subplot—not "
"fixed energy or force fields—so check the axis labels before running."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-range.md:22
#: 3780c7e008eb45d4be28fcce8882cedc
msgid "参数与执行结果"
msgstr "Parameters and execution result"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5073
#: c2301e06838f456c962fc3f4858608b5
msgid "输入控件："
msgstr "Input controls:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5074
#: ddf3970f5b8d457cb828ae57351b5a17
msgid "`x 最小值 / x 最大值 / y 最小值 / y 最大值`：范围 `[-1e8, 1e8]`，6 位小数；"
msgstr ""
"`x minimum / x maximum / y minimum / y maximum`: range `[-1e8, 1e8]`, six"
" decimal places;"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5075
#: 4dcca213b5354d63a1ba79e25669f3eb
msgid "`逻辑关系`：`同时满足（AND）` / `任一满足（OR）`，默认同时满足。"
msgstr ""
"`Logical relation`: `Match both (AND)` or `Match either (OR)`; default is"
" AND."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5076
#: b6d9713e55894bccb8772985f4884790
msgid "默认值：打开时自动填充为当前子图数据极值。"
msgstr ""
"Defaults: populated from the current subplot's data limits when the "
"dialog opens."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5077
#: 927e83b411064896bfa46a82c25a8298
msgid "执行结果：按坐标窗口筛选并选中结构。"
msgstr ""
"Result: select structures whose plotted coordinates satisfy the chosen "
"window."

