#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-range.md:29
#: 9bc0d363e2784092a9e1c01e6a2b9e99
msgid "操作后检查"
msgstr "Post-operation checks"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-range.md:31
#: bf246ba909b04d58829f8795b816e7d9
msgid ""
"范围框默认填入当前图的数据极值。缩小范围后先核对高亮点位置和 `Sel` 数量； `同时满足（AND）`要求 x、y "
"同时落入范围，`任一满足（OR）`只要求其中一项满足。"
msgstr ""
"The range fields initially use the current plot limits. After narrowing "
"them, verify the highlighted points and the `Sel` count. `Match both "
"(AND)` requires both x and y to lie in range, whereas `Match either (OR)`"
" requires only one."
